999
pnptask sim: the travel envelope (-20..620 x -20..520) and the two obstacles.
999
Layer "Outer Limits" carries the envelope, layer "deadzones" the obstacles.
999
Everything is closed, convex and in machine units (mm here) -- see D7/D22/D23.
999
The envelope is deliberately wider than the axis soft limits (0..600 x 0..500):
999
CLEARANCE erodes it by 12 mm, and a route's start and goal have to lie inside
999
the eroded boundary -- including the position the machine is parked at when a
999
job starts, which after homing is the corner of the axis range.
